{"ref":"BDB, כָּרַם","hw":"כָּרַם","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">כָּרַם</span>]</big>  <strong>vb.denom. tend vineyards, dress vines</strong>, only<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pt. pl. <em>vinedressers</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">כֹּרְמִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 25:12\" href=\"/II_Kings.25.12\">2 K 25:12</a> = <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 52:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.52.16\">Je 52:16</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יֹגְבִים</span>), <a data-ref=\"Joel 1:11\" href=\"/Joel.1.11\">Jo 1:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.10\">2 Ch 26:10</a> (both ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אִכָּרִים</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">כֹּרְמֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.5\">Is 61:5</a> (‖ <em>id.</em>)","next":"BDB, כַּרְמִי","prev":"BDB, כֶּרֶם"}